  <heading level="3">Data Availability Statement</heading>
The model weights and a minimun data of scDifformer are available in Huggingface project (
https://huggingface.co/allenxiao/scDIFFormer
). Source data are provided in this paper. The data processing code of scDifformer, together with training code for fine-tune models, is available at the Huggingface repository (
https://huggingface.co/allenxiao/scDIFFormer
).
